# core.autocrlf is on for this checkout, and Git's text/binary guess reads
# some of these as text -- a generated PDF has no NUL byte near the front.
# Left alone, Git would rewrite their line endings and corrupt the file.
*.pdf   binary
*.gp    binary
*.gp3   binary
*.gp4   binary
*.gp5   binary
*.gpx   binary
*.mid   binary
*.midi  binary
